  "definition": "Commercial Lobster Helper",
  "effectiveDate": "2018-11-01",
  "historyNote": "#7464, eff 3-23-01; ss by #9425, eff 3-17-09; ss by #9703, eff 5-1-10, EXPIRED: 5-1-18 New. #12655, EXEMPT, eff 11-1-18",
